{"steam_appid":3916260,"steam_name":"Psalm 2","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916260/113932204/52d200578585fa74f15651a50dfade62bc6d6ae8/1779132533/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779140455","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257338984/d7335bc119d2f657f0750646369693da91afd04c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779140455","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/140f33d868d98658eb5363e8e80afa825817c4cc/ss_140f33d868d98658eb5363e8e80afa825817c4cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779366432","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/543a833a953232f07f3808fb4b3cc7ea33a9e45e/ss_543a833a953232f07f3808fb4b3cc7ea33a9e45e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779366432","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/2762dce4c1fcba87db01f62af5aa00cd801513de/ss_2762dce4c1fcba87db01f62af5aa00cd801513de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779366432","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/a7dfa7e073b378ca812ad6d370f2ce3bdb4850ce/ss_a7dfa7e073b378ca812ad6d370f2ce3bdb4850ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779366432","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/90b375d210db2d8e5db3d92ed8ac0a9601b1b06d/ss_90b375d210db2d8e5db3d92ed8ac0a9601b1b06d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779366432"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/55f04da7ab88f19bc4c79969d509a075.poster.avif?t=1779366432\" width=1170 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/55f04da7ab88f19bc4c79969d509a075.webm?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/55f04da7ab88f19bc4c79969d509a075.mp4?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Psalm 2</strong> is a first-person indie horror walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximate playtime: 1 hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality sound</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/20f67aafa7a35ef2bdedf56170acbc4a.poster.avif?t=1779366432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/20f67aafa7a35ef2bdedf56170acbc4a.webm?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/20f67aafa7a35ef2bdedf56170acbc4a.mp4?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your elevator begins moving down. You don't know how many floors separate you from the bottom or what inhabits these dark shafts. You must come to realize: the descent will not continue until you see what is hidden.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/15bb7cfee6febe7f3774c6406e63f67f.poster.avif?t=1779366432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/15bb7cfee6febe7f3774c6406e63f67f.webm?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/15bb7cfee6febe7f3774c6406e63f67f.mp4?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move sequentially from floor to floor — each of which is a separate fragment of distorted reality. You don't know who or what lives here. You don't know if it's hiding around the corner, blending into the environment, or has no form at all. But the rule is always the same: the elevator won't go further until you find what is hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics and high-quality volumetric 3D sound will help you fully experience the game's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/70c96f1314ae18380f79ba64b4fbf216.poster.avif?t=1779366432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/70c96f1314ae18380f79ba64b4fbf216.webm?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916260/extras/70c96f1314ae18380f79ba64b4fbf216.mp4?t=1779366432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WARNING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashing lights that may trigger epileptic seizures.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 / Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 / Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Notex","a1esska","N4bA"],"publishers":["N4bA","a1esska","Notex"],"release_date":"May 21, 2026"}